; flags: --proofs
;
; Requirement: a difference can be justified the way an identity can.
;
; Observed: (prove (!= a b)) succeeds, and what it returns is not a
; derivation of the difference. It certifies that both terms exist and
; that the test passed just now.

(sort Sheet)
(constructor sheet (String) Sheet)
(sheet "a") (sheet "b")

(prove (!= (sheet "a") (sheet "b")))
